# #152 drills and multi-hit aerials: Dreadlord's neutral air (3 hits). Dreadlord a against Dreadlord b; syntax and checks: smashcraft:docs/native-bot-session.md.
#! chat -dev quick hero dreadlord
# Both dash in, close.
40 b stick -1 0
42 b stick 0 0
50 a stick 1 0
52 a stick 0 0
# Neutral air as both jump.
100 b tap B 8
100 a tap B 8
101 a stick 0.6 0
120 a tap A 2
120 a stick 0 0
# Frames saved on hits (native only; illustration for the look box).
126 a capture
139 a capture
# Expected, frame by frame (headless run of this script): the aerial starts, then every hit.
#! expect a 120 applied attack 1 style 12
#! expect b 126 damage 3.000
#! expect b 132 damage 6.000
#! expect b 139 damage 13.000
#! scene a CleaveDamageTarget
# View held a second, twice: the moments the parity check replays.
500 a press VIEW
570 a release VIEW
1000 a press VIEW
1070 a release VIEW
